 text-align: right;"><strong>TOTAL</strong></td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid gray; text-align: center">10,500</td></tr></table><h6>Distance Formula</h6><table border="0" style="border-collapse: collapse"><tr><td rowspan="2" style="; vertical-align: middle; text-align: right;">distance between a gene<br/>and its centromere</td><td rowspan="2" style="; vertical-align: middle; padding: 10px;">=</td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; text-align: center">&half; &times; (asci with second-division segregation patterns)</td></tr><tr><td style="border-top: 1px solid black; text-align: center">total number of asci</td></tr></table><h6>Question</h6><p>Using the numbers of asci for each pattern shown in the table above, <strong>determine the genetic distance between gene M and its centromere.</strong></p>
PROMPT_8674_3EF0
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CHOICE_1';
<sup>&half;&times;(1,053 + 1,060 + 3,190)</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = <sup>&half;&times;5,303</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = 0.2525 = 25.25 cM<br/>
LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CHOICE_2';
<sup>&half;&times;(1,018 + 3,131 + 3,190)</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = <sup>&half;&times;7,339</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = 0.3495 = 34.95 cM<br/>
LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CHOICE_3';
<sup>&half;&times;(3,131 + 3,190)</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = <sup>&half;&times;6,321</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = 0.3010 = 30.10 cM<br/>
LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CHOICE_4';
<sup>&half;&times;(1,018 + 1,053 + 3,131)</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = <sup>&half;&times;5,202</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = 0.2477 = 24.77 cM<br/>
LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CHOICE_5';
<sup>&half;&times;(1,018 + 1,048 + 1,053 + 1,060)</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = <sup>&half;&times;4,179</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = 0.1990 = 19.90 cM<br/>
LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CHOICE_6';
<sup>&half;&times;(1,018 + 1,048)</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = <sup>&half;&times;2,066</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = 0.0984 = 9.84 cM<br/>
LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CORRECT_1';
<sup>&half;&times;(1,018 + 1,048 + 1,053 + 1,060)</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = <sup>&half;&times;4,179</sup>/<sub>10,500</sub> = 0.1990 = 19.90 cM<br/>
LITERAL_8674_3EF0_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
